{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56299","headline":"赠还俗女真（题拟） · 史君宝","name":"赠还俗女真（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"脱却霞裾换（《绿窗新话》作「裙着」）绣裙，仙凡从此路[歧]（岐）（据《绿窗新话》改）分。\n蛾眉再画当时月，蝉鬓重梳旧日云。\n玉貌缓将鸾镜照，锦衾兼把麝香薰。\n屏帏乍得萧郎爱，更没心情忆老君。\n（见《类说》卷十二《纪异记》《绿窗新话》卷下引《纪异录》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"史君宝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}